      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"MessageInterpolatorFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.validation\"><code>MessageInterpolatorFactory</code></a> that will produce a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/validation/MessageInterpolator.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.validation\"><code>MessageInterpolator</code></a> that uses the given <code>messageSource</code> to resolve\nany message parameters before final interpolation.",
